  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The one gradient CTA per view.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn ds-btn-primary\">Download all pages</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid transparent;font-family:var(--font);font-weight:500;font-size:14.5px;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),box-shadow .18s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),transform .18s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}.ds-btn:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(244,98,29,.28)}.ds-btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ff7f37 0%,#f2570f 100%);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.35) inset,0 6px 16px -4px rgba(226,78,12,.55)}.ds-btn-primary:hover{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ff8b47 0%,#f4621d 100%)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ghost Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-ghost",
      "description": "Secondary actions beside the primary.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-ghost\">Resend</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-ghost{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:42px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font);font-weight:500;font-size:14.5px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(28,22,16,.04);cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s,border-color .18s}.ds-btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--line-strong);background:var(--surface-2)}.ds-btn-ghost:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(244,98,29,.28)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin Split CTA",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "split-cta",
      "description": "Sidebar standing primary in admin: New invite plus menu.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-split\"><button class=\"ds-split-main\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg>New invite</button><button class=\"ds-split-more\" aria-label=\"More actions\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-split{display:flex;align-items:stretch;width:228px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ff7f37 0%,#f2570f 100%);box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.35) inset,0 6px 16px -4px rgba(226,78,12,.55)}.ds-split>button{background:transparent;border:0;color:#fff;font-family:var(--font);font-weight:500;cursor:pointer}.ds-split>button:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08)}.ds-split>button:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(244,98,29,.28)}.ds-split-main{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:0 18px 0 20px;min-height:50px;font-size:15px;flex:1;border-radius:999px 0 0 999px}.ds-split-more{width:46px;border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28)!important;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:0 999px 999px 0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Filter Chips",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "filter-chip",
      "description": "Library filters with count bubble; selected inverts to ink.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-filters\"><button class=\"ds-filter\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All<span class=\"ds-count\">8</span></button><button class=\"ds-filter\" aria-pressed=\"false\">My packs<span class=\"ds-count\">3</span></button><button class=\"ds-filter\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Locked<span class=\"ds-count\">4</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-filters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.ds-filter{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:38px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);font-family:var(--font);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer}.ds-filter:hover{border-color:var(--line-strong)}.ds-filter:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(244,98,29,.28)}.ds-count{min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 6px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:999px;background:var(--sunken);font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ds-filter[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);color:var(--canvas)}.ds-filter[aria-pressed=\"true\"] .ds-count{background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);color:inherit}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Pills and Feed Chips",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "pill-owned",
      "description": "Owned (solid green), price (orange-soft with padlock), lifecycle soft pills, mention and code chips.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-row\"><span class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-green\"><span class=\"ds-dot\"></span>Unlocked</span><span class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-orange\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"11\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"/></svg>R 89</span><span class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-blue\"><span class=\"ds-dot\"></span>Opened</span><span class=\"ds-pill ds-pill-grey\">Coming soon</span></div><p class=\"ds-feed\"><span class=\"ds-mention\">@Thandi</span> unlocked <span class=\"ds-code\">#10482</span></p>",
      "css": ".ds-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.ds-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:28px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:999px;font-family:var(--font);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap}.ds-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}.ds-pill-green{background:var(--green);color:#fff}.ds-pill-green .ds-dot{background:#fff}.ds-pill-orange{background:var(--orange-soft);color:var(--orange-ink)}.ds-pill-blue{background:var(--blue-soft);color:var(--blue-ink)}.ds-pill-grey{background:var(--sunken);color:var(--muted)}.ds-feed{font-family:var(--font);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink)}.ds-mention{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--violet-soft);color:var(--violet-ink);font-weight:500}.ds-mention::after{content:\"\";width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--green)}.ds-code{display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--sunken);color:var(--ink);font-weight:500;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "48px field with 14px radius; orange border and ring on focus.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span class=\"ds-label\">Email</span><input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"you@example.co.za\"><span class=\"ds-hint\">We send your sign-in link here.</span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:grid;gap:7px;font-family:var(--font);max-width:360px}.ds-label{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink-2)}.ds-hint{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}.ds-input{width:100%;min-height:48px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font:inherit;font-size:15px;transition:border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--faint)}.ds-input:hover{border-color:var(--faint)}.ds-input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--orange-500);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(244,98,29,.28)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sidebar Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-item",
      "description": "Active item is a raised white tile with an orange icon.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 19V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h4v16H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1zM9 4h4v16H9zM14 5l4-1 3 15-4 1z\"/></svg>Library<span class=\"ds-badge\">3</span></a><a href=\"#\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"/></svg>Profile</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:grid;gap:2px;width:228px;padding:8px;background:var(--canvas-2);font-family:var(--font)}.ds-nav a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:14px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;font-weight:500}.ds-nav a:hover{background:var(--sunken);color:var(--ink)}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(244,98,29,.28)}.ds-nav a[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(28,22,16,.05),0 6px 18px -8px rgba(28,22,16,.10)}.ds-nav a[aria-current=\"page\"] svg{color:var(--orange-500)}.ds-badge{margin-left:auto;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 7px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--orange-soft);color:var(--orange-ink);font-size:12px;display:grid;place-items:center}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Pack Card (owned / locked)",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "pack-card",
      "description": "Signature: pastel field cover; owned coloured with green pill, locked desaturated with padlock disc and price pill.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-packs\"><button class=\"ds-pack\"><div class=\"ds-cover\" style=\"background:#d6ebf8\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\" width=\"78%\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1d1b18\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"42\" r=\"17\" fill=\"#ffc94a\"/><path d=\"M52 92 L100 62 L148 92 Z\" fill=\"#d9573b\"/><rect x=\"62\" y=\"90\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f0c27a\"/><path d=\"M22 124 H178 L160 158 H40 Z\" fill=\"#b7743f\"/></svg></div><div class=\"ds-body\"><h3>Noah and the Ark</h3><div class=\"ds-foot\"><span class=\"ds-meta\">12 pages</span><span class=\"ds-pill-own\"><span class=\"ds-d\"></span>Unlocked</span></div></div></button><button class=\"ds-pack ds-locked\"><div class=\"ds-cover\" style=\"background:#cbedee\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\" width=\"78%\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1d1b18\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"42\" r=\"17\"/><path d=\"M52 92 L100 62 L148 92 Z\"/><rect x=\"62\" y=\"90\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M22 124 H178 L160 158 H40 Z\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-lock\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"11\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"ds-body\"><h3>Jonah and the Whale</h3><div class=\"ds-foot\"><span class=\"ds-meta\">8 pages</span><span class=\"ds-pill-price\">R 69</span></div></div></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-packs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,236px);gap:18px;font-family:var(--font)}.ds-pack{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--surface) 0%,var(--surface-2) 100%);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(28,22,16,.05),0 6px 18px -8px rgba(28,22,16,.10);overflow:hidden;text-align:left;padding:0;color:var(--ink);font:inherit;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),box-shadow .25s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}.ds-pack:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(28,22,16,.06),0 18px 40px -16px rgba(28,22,16,.22)}.ds-pack:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(244,98,29,.28)}.ds-cover{position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/3.4;margin:10px 10px 0;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;display:grid;place-items:center}.ds-locked .ds-cover{filter:saturate(.5)}.ds-lock{position:absolute;right:12px;top:12px;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:rgba(28,26,23,.82);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 16px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}.ds-body{padding:14px 16px 16px;display:grid;gap:10px}.ds-body h3{margin:0;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.015em}.ds-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px}.ds-meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px}.ds-pill-own,.ds-pill-price{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:28px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500}.ds-pill-own{background:var(--green);color:#fff}.ds-d{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff}.ds-pill-price{background:var(--orange-soft);color:var(--orange-ink)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Countdown Card",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "countdown-clock",
      "description": "Admin KPI-row card: next expiring invite with violet clock tile.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-cd\"><div class=\"ds-cd-top\"><div><b>Lerato’s invite</b><span>lerato@example.co.za</span></div><span class=\"ds-exp\">Expiring</span></div><div class=\"ds-clock\">05<span>:</span>42<span>:</span>18</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-cd{width:300px;padding:18px 18px 16px;display:grid;gap:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--surface),var(--surface-2));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(28,22,16,.05),0 6px 18px -8px rgba(28,22,16,.10);font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink)}.ds-cd-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px}.ds-cd-top b{display:block;font-size:18px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-cd-top span{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.ds-cd-top .ds-exp{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:28px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:500}.ds-clock{border-radius:18px;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#7b72e8,#564cc9);color:#fff;font-size:30px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.02em;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;box-shadow:0 16px 30px -14px rgba(86,76,201,.8),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.25)}.ds-clock span{opacity:.55;font-size:26px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "KPI Card with Mini Chart",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Admin metric: icon label, 38px tabular value, five orange-gradient bars.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-kpi\"><span class=\"ds-kpi-l\">Members</span><div class=\"ds-kpi-r\"><span class=\"ds-kpi-v\">214</span><div class=\"ds-bars\"><i style=\"height:45%\"></i><i style=\"height:70%\"></i><i style=\"height:55%\"></i><i style=\"height:90%\"></i><i style=\"height:75%\"></i></div></div><span class=\"ds-kpi-d\">+18 this month</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-kpi{width:240px;padding:18px 20px 20px;display:grid;gap:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--surface),var(--surface-2));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(28,22,16,.05),0 6px 18px -8px rgba(28,22,16,.10);font-family:var(--font)}.ds-kpi-l{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2)}.ds-kpi-r{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between}.ds-kpi-v{font-size:38px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--ink)}.ds-bars{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:4px;height:38px}.ds-bars i{width:7px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--orange-400),var(--orange-500))}.ds-kpi-d{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--green-ink);font-weight:500}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Warm Dashboard, Loud Art",
    "overview": "Kingdom Members wears a pinned SaaS dashboard world (the user's \"Ware Sync\" reference) and lets one thing shout: the colouring-pack artwork. Everything around it is a quiet, warm grey-white canvas, soft white cards with generous 22px corners, and one orange gradient that marks the way forward. The chrome is calm on purpose, so pastel pack fields with thick-line art carry the colour.\n\nDensity is moderate and dashboard-like: a 264px sidebar, a greeting headline, filter chips, then a grid of cards. Every interactive shape is a full pill, and every container is a large rounded card lifted by warm, diffuse shadows. Type is Google Sans only, set at weight 500 for everything that names something and 400 for running text. Owned and locked are shown by colour. Owned covers are fully coloured. Locked covers show desaturated line art with a dark padlock disc and an orange price pill.\n\nThe world rejects the generic LMS course grid and the cream-and-serif \"kids' faith\" look. It is warm without being cream and friendly without a display serif.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm grey-white canvas (`canvas`) with white, barely graded cards (`surface` to `surface-2`).",
      "One orange gradient (`cta-glow` to `cta-deep`) for primary action, progress, KPI mini-bars and brand panels.",
